    {
     "tag": "Construct",
     "text": "Given four or five organisms, write paired statements about visible features, each pair leading to a name or to a numbered step. Check every organism can be reached."
    },
    {
     "tag": "Never",
     "text": "Use colour, size or habitat; write two statements that are not opposites; leave an organism with nowhere to go."
    }
